<title>UK: Hitachi sets $200 mln five-year bond, 28 bp over.</title>
<headline>Hitachi sets $200 mln five-year bond, 28 bp over.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HITACHI CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     **	  MATURITY    10.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    10.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+28 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.50 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 31.MAY.02</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
